 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nNorthwind Trading Inc\n88 Commerce Drive, 80201 Denver, United States\nVAT No: US98-0921070\n\nMASTER SERVICES\nAGREEMENT\n\nFROM\n\nNorthwind Trading Inc\n88 Commerce Drive\n80201 Denver\nUnited States\nVAT: US98-0921070\n\nPAID [struck]\nBILL TO\nHarborline Foods Corp\n1200 Industrial Parkway\n80201 Denver\nUnited States\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 02/11/2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and between Northwind\nTrading Inc, with its registered office at 88 Commerce Drive, Denver (\"Party A\"), and Harborline Foods Corp, with its registered office at\n1200 Industrial Parkway, Denver (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 12 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in accordance with\nSection 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the purposes of this\nAgreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of the State of New York.\n\nSignatures\nParty A    Northwind Trading Inc / Maria Lopez\nParty B    Harborline Foods Corp / David Kim\nDate       02/11/2026",
